       X(7), Xserver(1), mkfontdir(1), ttmkfdir(1), xfs(1), xset(1)

NNOOTTEESS
       The format of the ffoonnttss..ssccaallee, ffoonnttss..ddiirr  and  eennccooddiinnggss..ddiirr  files  is
       documented in the mkfontdir(1) manual page.

       MMkkffoonnttssccaallee  will  overwrite  any  ffoonnttss..ssccaallee file even if it has been
       hand-edited.

       mmkkffoonnttssccaallee --bb --ss --ll is equivalent to mmkkffoonnttddiirr.

